> {{ site.title }}: {{ site.subtitle }} is a calm, practical self-help book by {{ site.author }} about the small pause between what happens and what you do next, and how to build the steadiness to respond instead of react. Kindle edition published 1 August 2026 (ASIN {{ site.book.kindle.asin }}); paperback published 2 August 2026 (ISBN {{ site.book.paperback.isbn }}). The aim is not to feel less, but to be moved less.

